WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
"The fountains mingle with the river".

2
00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:05.070
The rivers run into the ocean.

3
00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.420
Mountains touch the sky.

4
00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.210
Two waves meet.

5
00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.410
Sunlight holds the earth.

6
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.100
Every piece clicks into place.

7
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:16.920
Then the voice turns to someone, and asks,

8
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:18.870
"If thou kiss not me?"

9
00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.500
Is this poet in love with
nature, or just using it?

10
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.800
Love poem, or sales pitch?

11
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:29.290
In this mission, you'll test what nature's
pairings are doing in each stanza.

12
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.810
Just pretty pictures?

13
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:34.520
You'll find out why each stanza
ends on its shortest line,

14
00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.540
a question nobody answers.

15
00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:40.560
And you'll watch the verbs
change, from mingle to kiss.

16
00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:44.530
Your mission: decide whether it's
a love poem or a sales pitch.
